                            'messages;</li><li>housing and directions;</li><li>pharmacy '
                            'and doctors;</li><li>banking and documents;</li><li>work and '
                            'study communication;</li><li>listening and '
                            'response.</li></ul>',
                            '<p>Vedium’s approach is “fluency beyond words”: not only '
